' ============================================================================
' Deploy_nikolaigogol__AddDependencyHomeManager.puml
'
' Purpose : Add a runtime dependency to the ds13 home-manager profile inside
'           the @NikolaiGogol NixOS container, without touching the system.
' Scope   : Unix_dotfiles flake -> deploy-rs -> home-manager profile on
'           ds13@NikolaiGogol (direct SSH override, port 2223).
' Date    : 2026-11-01
'
' Invariants:
'   * The container must already be running and reachable; the container
'     image is NOT rebuilt and the NixOS system closure is NOT switched.
'   * Only the user profile changes: user packages and dotfiles from the
'     home-manager module. System services belong to the system scope.
'   * deploy-rs still copies the closure, runs a dry pass, then activates;
'     activation switches the home-manager generation only.
'   * @NikolaiGogol is NixOS, so home-manager packages may rely on the
'     system layer; @terra (TOS 6) has no such layer (see the terra diagram).
'   * DEPLOY_HOST is not used here: the target is the direct SSH host
'     ds13@NikolaiGogol. hosts.ini is still authoritative for that entry.
'
' Render: plantuml -tpng -tsvg docs/_diagrams/Deploy_nikolaigogol__AddDependencyHomeManager.puml
' ============================================================================

@startuml
!include _shared/DeployCommon.puml
autonumber
title Add a dependency to the @NikolaiGogol home-manager profile

actor Operator
participant "Terra (TOS 6)\nDocker host" as Terra
participant "NikolaiGogol\nNixOS container\nsshd :2223" as NG
participant "Unix_dotfiles\nflake + deploy-rs" as Dotfiles
participant "Control node\nnix / deploy-rs" as Control
participant "HM profile\nds13" as HM

$ContainerReachable(Operator, Terra, NG, "ssh -p 2223 ds13@terra-local true\n(or docker exec HomeServer__HomeAssistant.NikolaiGogol true)")

$DeclareDependency(Operator, Dotfiles, "the ds13 home-manager module for NikolaiGogol")

$DeployRs(Operator, Dotfiles, Control, NG, HM, "home-manager generation switch\n(system profile untouched)", "home-manager profile", "deploy .#homeConfigurations.ds13@NikolaiGogol\n--target-host ds13@NikolaiGogol")
note over Dotfiles, HM
  What changes: user packages + dotfiles in the ds13
  home-manager generation.
  What does not: the NixOS system closure, running
  systemd services, and the container image/rootfs.
end note

$Verify(Operator, NG, "command -v [package]; [package] --version", "readlink -f &#126;/.local/state/nix/profiles/home-manager")
note right of NG
  The home-manager profile points at the new
  generation; system generations are unchanged.
end note

$FailureRollback(Control, NG, "activation fails", "Roll back to the previous home-manager generation (home-manager rollback / activate the prior generation). Do not recreate the container to fix a user-profile failure.")
@enduml
